<title>USA: Atlanta Fed index 22.1 in April vs rvsd 8.6 March.</title>
<headline>Atlanta Fed index 22.1 in April vs rvsd 8.6 March.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve Bank of Atlanta said on Tuesday its index of industry business activity rose to 22.1 in April from a revised 8.6 in March.</p>
<p>					 April	     March (rvsd)</p>
<p>Industry Business Index	  22.1		    8.6</p>
<p>Production Index		   18.3		    9.8</p>
<p>Prices Received		     4.0		    4.3</p>
<p>Prices Paid			  16.4		   18.5</p>
<p>Backlog of Orders		   9.1		  -11.0</p>
<p>New Orders			   29.2		    1.1</p>
<p>Shipments			    23.9		    2.6</p>
<p>Number of Employees		 4.5		    4.7</p>
<p>Inventories of Finished Goods   2.0		    0.1</p>
<p>Materials Inventories	    -4.9		  - 6.7</p>
<p>Supplier Delivery Time	    2.2		    5.5</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
</text>
